  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rvaltningsreform Serbie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAR Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudsyftet med projetektet &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;rvaltningsreform i Serbien. En framg&#xe5;ngsrik implementering av projektet &#xe4;r av h&#xf6;gsta vikt f&#xf6;r landets EU-integrationsprocess. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av effektivitet, ansvarsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden och transparens inom den serbiska offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this programme is to support the reform of public administration in the Republic of Serbia. The successful  implementation of this programme is of the highest importance for hte country&apos;s EU intergration process. The overall objective is to support improvement of the efficiency, accountability and transparency in Serbian Public Administration.</narrative>
  </description>
